sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Applicant as Applicant / CSC Operator
    participant UI as DocuReady Interface
    participant Ingest as Document Ingestion
    participant Extractor as Extraction Pipeline
    participant Calibrator as Calibration Engine
    participant Validator as Statutory Engine
    participant Safety as Safety Layer

    Applicant->>UI: Upload Document Packet (6 Documents)
    UI->>Ingest: Transmit Files
    Ingest->>Extractor: Ingest Documents (PDF/Raster)
    Extractor->>Extractor: Dual-Route Vector / OCR Extraction
    Extractor->>Calibrator: Pass Extracted Fields & Metadata
    Calibrator->>Calibrator: Compute 9 Calibration Features
    Calibrator->>Calibrator: Calculate Probability & State (VERIFIED/PROVISIONAL/UNCERTAIN)
    Calibrator->>Validator: Provide Calibrated Fields
    Validator->>Validator: Normalize Names, Dates, Incomes
    Validator->>Validator: Evaluate 10 Cross-Document Statutory Rules
    Validator->>Safety: Send Raw Findings
    Safety->>Safety: Check Evidence States of Supporting Fields
    Safety->>Safety: Downgrade Uncertain Violations to REVIEW
    Safety->>UI: Return Final Audit Findings & Remediation Steps
    UI->>Applicant: Display Interactive Dashboard with PDF Bounding Boxes
    opt Document Remediation
        Applicant->>UI: Upload Replacement Document
        UI->>Extractor: Re-extract Replaced Document
        UI->>Validator: Re-run Cross-Document Audit
        Validator->>UI: Display Updated Real-Time Audit Status
    end
